+</style>
+<h1>Electric: complete exterior rebuild</h1>
+<p>New bodywork, a continuous arched canopy, rounded nose, fitted optical assemblies, recessed rear plate and new aero wheels. Built for a coherent sporty silhouette and a lighter racing model. <a href="../../ELECTRIC_REBUILD_2026_10_27.md">Changes, verification and limits</a>.</p>
+<div class="facts"><span>Full model: <b>115,686</b> triangles (27% fewer)</span><span>Racing: <b>36,952</b> triangles (53% fewer)</span><span>Prepared meshes: <b>403</b> (previously 864)</span></div>
+<div class="controls">
+<label>View<select id="view"><option value="front-quarter" selected>Front three-quarter</option><option value="side">Side</option><option value="front">Front</option><option value="rear-quarter">Rear three-quarter</option><option value="rear">Rear</option><option value="top">Top</option><option value="bonnet">Bonnet</option><option value="roof">Roof and glazing</option><option value="wheel">Wheel</option><option value="tail-detail">Rear detail</option><option value="production-camera-studio">Default racing camera over studio</option></select></label>
+<label>Detail<select id="detail"><option value="full">Full</option><option value="simple">Simple</option></select></label>
+<label>Renderer<select id="renderer"><option value="native">Compatibility</option><option value="desktop-mobile">Mobile on desktop Vulkan</option></select></label>
+</div>
+<div class="compare"><img id="before" src="before-native/full-front-quarter.png" alt="Before: original electric car"><img id="after" class="after" src="native/full-front-quarter.png" alt="After: revised electric car"><div id="divider" class="divider"></div><span class="badge left">After · v14</span><span class="badge right">Before · v13</span></div>
+<label class="slider">Reveal the revision<input id="reveal" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" aria-label="Amount of after image visible"></label>
+<p><small>Matched neutral-grey studio views. Drag the slider or use its arrow keys. The production-camera option uses the unchanged camera profile over the diagnostic studio, not an actual race scene. “Mobile” here identifies the desktop renderer; it is not a device test.</small></p>
+<div class="grid"><figure><a id="before-link" href="before-native/full-front-quarter.png"><img id="before-whole" src="before-native/full-front-quarter.png" alt="Complete before view"></a><figcaption>Before · source-matched task-start model</figcaption></figure><figure><a id="after-link" href="native/full-front-quarter.png"><img id="after-whole" src="native/full-front-quarter.png" alt="Complete revised view"></a><figcaption>After · revised model, same pose and paint</figcaption></figure></div>
+<p><a href="app-native/garage-1280.png">Actual Garage</a> · <a href="app-native/race.png">Actual gameplay</a> · <a href="model-native/electric-headlights.png">Headlights</a> · <a href="report.json">Commands and evidence</a> · <a href="../electric-design-review-2026-10-26/comparison.html">Original EV comparison review</a></p>
+<p><small>Fictional vehicle, original authored game geometry. Reference manufacturers remain design references outside the game assets. Reload the project/game to see the new prepared model in an existing session.</small></p>
+<script>
+const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);
+function update(){const suffix=$('detail').value+'-'+$('view').value+'.png';const before='before-'+$('renderer').value+'/'+suffix;const after=$('renderer').value+'/'+suffix;for(const id of ['before','before-whole'])$(id).src=before;for(const id of ['after','after-whole'])$(id).src=after;$('before-link').href=before;$('after-link').href=after;}
+for(const id of ['view','detail','renderer'])$(id).addEventListener('change',update);
+$('reveal').addEventListener('input',()=>{const value=Number($('reveal').value);$('after').style.clipPath='inset(0 '+(100-value)+'% 0 0)';$('divider').style.left=value+'%';});
+update();
+</script></html>
